# Backend Layered Architecture

## Controllers (`*.controller.ts`)

HTTP requests only. Delegate all logic to services.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
@Get(':id')
findOne(@Param('id') id: string) {
  return this.healthService.getHealth();
}

// ❌ BAD — direct DB access in controller
@Get(':id')
findOne(@Param('id') id: string) {
  return this.repository.findOne({ where: { id } });
}
```

## Services (`*.service.ts`)

Business logic, validation, and exceptions. Inject repositories — never TypeORM.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
async getHealth() {
  await this.healthRepository.pingDatabase();
  return { status: 'ok' };
}
```

## Repositories (`*.repository.ts`)

Database calls only. No HTTP decorators, no business exceptions.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
pingDatabase() {
  return this.dataSource.query('SELECT 1');
}
```
